# Helper tests

## Setup

```php
$view = new View();
$this->Helper = new XxxHelper($view);
```

Namespace: `Brammo\BootstrapUI\Test\TestCase\View\Helper`. Extend `Cake\TestSuite\TestCase`.

## Naming and assertions

- Test methods: `testFeatureScenario`
- Assert meaningful HTML: Bootstrap classes (`card`, `table-responsive`), roles, `data-bs-*`, ARIA
- Do not keep tests for removed options (e.g. Card `title`)
- Prefer `assertStringContainsString` for fragments; use `assertHtml()` when structure is critical (Nav tabs)

## Coverage rule

Any helper behavior change requires a test update or new test in the matching `*HelperTest.php`.
